(7458505, 1181883, 181814, '<td valign="top">I like the face of the cow but I do have a problem with the composition i.e. the white section of fence on the bottom and also I think you have overexposed part of the face losing much detail. I''m also not a big fan of the noise throughout the image/photograph.</td>', 'I like the face of the cow but I do have a problem with the composition i.e. the white section of fence on the bottom and also I think you have overexposed part of the face losing much detail. I''m also not a big fan of the noise throughout the image/photograph.', '2016-06-03 21:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7458506, 1181892, 181814, '<td valign="top">I would like this much better had you zoomed in on the yawning ladies face eliminating most of the other people who are making the photograph cluttered in my opinion. There''s also quite a bit of noise within the shadowy areas of the photograph.</td>', 'I would like this much better had you zoomed in on the yawning ladies face eliminating most of the other people who are making the photograph cluttered in my opinion. There''s also quite a bit of noise within the shadowy areas of the photograph.', '2016-06-03 21:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7458507, 1181916, 181814, '<td valign="top">The face is goofy for sure and the exposure and composition are not bad but there is something not quite right about the left side of the lady''s face, maybe you removed too much noise or something because it looks very smooth compared to the rest of the face.</td>', 'The face is goofy for sure and the exposure and composition are not bad but there is something not quite right about the left side of the lady''s face, maybe you removed too much noise or something because it looks very smooth compared to the rest of the face.', '2016-06-03 21:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7458508, 1181823, 181814, '<td valign="top">I like the goofiness of the face for sure, I think the exposure could have been better, the focus is very well done.</td>', 'I like the goofiness of the face for sure, I think the exposure could have been better, the focus is very well done.', '2016-06-03 21:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7458509, 1181938, 181814, '<td valign="top">The crossed eyes do make her look funny, however the postprocessing wipes out any skin details making her look plasticky. I think the exposure could have been better.</td>', 'The crossed eyes do make her look funny, however the postprocessing wipes out any skin details making her look plasticky. I think the exposure could have been better.', '2016-06-03 21:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7458510, 1181970, 181814, '<td valign="top">Would have been a nice photograph for this theme if only it had been in focus.</td>', 'Would have been a nice photograph for this theme if only it had been in focus.', '2016-06-03 21:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7458511, 1182012, 181814, '<td valign="top">The photograph is nice but I don''t know that the faces are that goofy in my opinion. I also think it may have looked better had you either cropped out the left side to eliminate the corner of the building.</td>', 'The photograph is nice but I don''t know that the faces are that goofy in my opinion. I also think it may have looked better had you either cropped out the left side to eliminate the corner of the building.', '2016-06-03 21:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7458512, 1181906, 181814, '<td valign="top">This photograph would have been much much better had you cropped out the dead space on the left and right, I also am not a big fan of your postprocessing i.e. what looks like a texture applied over the lady.</td>', 'This photograph would have been much much better had you cropped out the dead space on the left and right, I also am not a big fan of your postprocessing i.e. what looks like a texture applied over the lady.', '2016-06-03 21:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7458513, 1181989, 181814, '<td valign="top">This is very nice and fits the theme completely, the exposure the focus and the composition are all very well done. I think this should do well in this contest for sure.</td>', 'This is very nice and fits the theme completely, the exposure the focus and the composition are all very well done. I think this should do well in this contest for sure.', '2016-06-03 21:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7458514, 1181802, 181814, '<td valign="top">I think the face is goofy and the composition, focus and exposure are well done. I''m not a big fan of the border and the color tone.</td>', 'I think the face is goofy and the composition, focus and exposure are well done. I''m not a big fan of the border and the color tone.', '2016-06-03 21:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7458515, 1181973, 181814, '<td valign="top">This is very nicely done with the exception of the teddy bear on the left side, it is a bit distracting. Otherwise I think this photograph should do well.</td>', 'This is very nicely done with the exception of the teddy bear on the left side, it is a bit distracting. Otherwise I think this photograph should do well.', '2016-06-03 21:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
