(7458523, 1181881, 181814, '<td valign="top">I sure like the point of view and the expression on the guy''s face is very goofy. I like the exposure the focus and the composition for the most part. The only thing I''m not a big fan of on the composition is cutting off a sliver of the foot at the bottom.</td>', 'I sure like the point of view and the expression on the guy''s face is very goofy. I like the exposure the focus and the composition for the most part. The only thing I''m not a big fan of on the composition is cutting off a sliver of the foot at the bottom.', '2016-06-03 21:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
