(7459870, 1181992, 104230, '<td valign="top"><br/>The image is priceless by itself, but then to read this "<i>Jesse had no idea what had been done.</i>". That''s the part I find really great. What was his reaction when you showed him the images, or when he saw the back of Jeff''s head, whichever occurred first?</td>', 'The image is priceless by itself, but then to read this "Jesse had no idea what had been done.". That''s the part I find really great. What was his reaction when you showed him the images, or when he saw the back of Jeff''s head, whichever occurred first?', '2016-06-11 23:01:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(7459934, 1181992, 103142, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by PennyClick:</b></div><hr/><i> The image is priceless by itself, but then to read this "<i>Jesse had no idea what had been done.</i>". That''s the part I find really great. What was his reaction when you showed him the images, or when he saw the back of Jeff''s head, whichever occurred first? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>He came down and saw it, and was laughing so hard that I had to keep waiting before shooting, so he could settle down a bit. That''s why there''s no camera smile -- this is coming off a long laugh. :)</td>', 'Originally posted by PennyClick: The image is priceless by itself, but then to read this "Jesse had no idea what had been done.". That''s the part I find really great. What was his reaction when you showed him the images, or when he saw the back of Jeff''s head, whichever occurred first?   He came down and saw it, and was laughing so hard that I had to keep waiting before shooting, so he could settle down a bit. That''s why there''s no camera smile -- this is coming off a long laugh. :)', '2016-06-12 21:23:43.000000', NULL, 0),
